  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Optional vim-style navigation (--vim) by @cogitatorum in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/21\r\n* fix: address PR #21 review comments by @felangga in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/22\r\n* fix: add json tags to Metadata struct by @felangga in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/26\r\n* fix: avoid holding history mutex during disk I/O by @felangga in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/24\r\n* fix: robust semver comparison with error handling by @felangga in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/25\r\n* fix: defer response printing until final trailers are received by @felangga in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/27\r\n* fix: drop events on full queue instead of blocking caller by @felangga in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/28\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @cogitatorum made their first contribution in https://github.com/felangga/chiko/pull/21\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/felangga/chiko/compare/v0.2.0...v0.3.0",
